---
layout: base.njk
---

{% include 'sitenav.njk' %}

<header class="tdbc-hero">
  <div class="tdbc-container">
    {#- nome con "Xab" come timbro e foto in una finestra da menu di Final
        Fantasy con scheda personaggio: _about.scss. Tutto CSS/SVG originale
        (nessuno sprite, logo o font di Square Enix). Le voci restano in
        inglese anche nella pagina italiana, come nei menu dei giochi. #}
    <h1 class="tdbc-ink--primary tdbc-mb-none titolo about-name">Andrea Corinti <span class="about-name__nick">Xab</span></h1>
    <figure class="about-photo">
      {%- if lang and lang.startsWith('en') %}{% set ffLabel = "Make your move: poison or cure" %}{% else %}{% set ffLabel = "Fai la tua mossa: veleno o cura" %}{% endif %}
      <button type="button" class="about-photo__cursor" aria-label="{{ ffLabel }}" title="{{ ffLabel }}"><svg class="about-photo__cursor-icon" viewBox="0 0 26 16" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g class="about-photo__cursor-ink"><rect x="10" y="3" width="15" height="4.6" rx="2.3"/><rect x="3.5" y="3" width="11.5" height="11" rx="3"/><rect x="0.8" y="4.2" width="3.6" height="8.6" rx="1"/></g><g class="about-photo__cursor-fill"><rect x="10" y="3" width="15" height="4.6" rx="2.3"/><rect x="3.5" y="3" width="11.5" height="11" rx="3"/><rect x="0.8" y="4.2" width="3.6" height="8.6" rx="1"/></g><path class="about-photo__cursor-line" d="M9 7.6h5.2M9 10.3h5M9 13h4.2M4.4 4.2v8.6"/></svg></button>
      <div class="about-photo__row">
        <div class="about-photo__portrait">
          <img class="u-photo about-photo__img" src="{{ avatar }}" alt="Andrea Corinti" width="400" height="400">
        </div>
        <div class="about-photo__sheet">
        <p class="about-photo__name">Xab</p>
        <dl class="about-photo__stats">
          <dt>Lv</dt><dd>{% xabLevel %}</dd>
          <dt>HP</dt><dd aria-live="polite"><span class="about-photo__hp" data-max="9999">7777</span>/9999</dd>
          <dt>MP</dt><dd>999/999</dd>
          <dt>Job</dt><dd>Web World Citizen</dd>
        </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="about-photo__status">Status <span>Poison</span></p>
    </figure>
    <script src="/js/ff-about.js" defer></script>
    <h2 class="tdbc-lead tdbc-content-maxlength tdbc-ink--gray tdbc-mx-auto p-note about-tagline">
      An Italian Web World Citizen.
    </h2>
    {# stesso pulsante dei post bilingui (postita/posteng), guidato da `translation` #}
    {% if translation %}
    {% if lang and lang.startsWith('en') %}
    <p class="tdbc-mt-sm"><a class="cat-btn cat-btn--italiano" href="{{ translation }}" hreflang="it" lang="it"><span class="cat-btn__flag" aria-hidden="true">🇮🇹</span>Leggi in italiano</a></p>
    {% else %}
    <p class="tdbc-mt-sm"><a class="cat-btn cat-btn--english" href="{{ translation }}" hreflang="en" lang="en"><span class="cat-btn__flag" aria-hidden="true">🇬🇧</span>Read in English</a></p>
    {% endif %}
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</header>
<main id="main-content" class="tdbc-container">
{{ content | safe }}

<div class="h-card" style="height: 0; overflow: hidden;">
  <p class="p-name">Andrea Corinti</p>
  <span class="p-nickname">Xab</span>
  <img class="u-photo" src="{{ avatar }}" alt="Andrea Corinti"/>
  <p class="p-note">An Italian Web World Citizen. Freelance content & e-learning platform coordinator; works with Edizioni Edilingua among other clients. Bio is a Poison-elemental attack that can inflict the Poison status.</p>
  <a class="u-url" rel="me" href="https://www.andreacorinti.com/">https://www.andreacorinti.com/</a>
  <a class="u-url" rel="me" href="https://mastodon.social/@Xabacadabra">https://mastodon.social/@Xabacadabra</a>
  <a class="u-url" rel="me" href="{{ meta.bluesky.profile }}">{{ meta.bluesky.profile }}</a>
  <div class="p-category">Webdev</div>
</div>
</main>